<title>MEXICO: Hylsamex 1996 net rises.</title>
<headline>Hylsamex 1996 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			 1995</p>
<p>     Oper Income	  1.662 bln		1.597 bln</p>
<p>     Net		    2.072 bln	     309.73 million</p>
<p>     Revs		   9.679 bln		8.872 bln</p>
